        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sequel to Bad Dog, Good Time. This is a SFW sequel, please enjoy and thank you. After Bad Dog, Good Time and visiting a little party, you met a few friends, which includes Banjo who you definitely didn't play patty-cake with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You had his number from a group-chat, but you broke your phone at work the next day, when getting a new phone, you lost your conversations and most of your contacts. You wondered if you'd ever see him again, does he think you ghosted him? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short visual novel to bridge a gap of time in between the two NSFW titles. It's primary goal is to provide a small backstory and feel of the character outside of the bedroom fun in the two games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a few gameplay elements that fall outside of the typical visual novel click-through and read. There is an early build of asteroid dodger which is an arcade style game, there is a mini-fishing game which gives a glimpse of what gameplay elements might come in Bad Dog, Good Nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overall, I hope you enjoy reading and trying out a few new features planned and also knowing where the player (you) fits into all the titles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the second ever title I've built, I've tried to learn and add in a new few things, its not much but I hope you enjoy.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sequel to Bad Dog, Good Time. This is a SFW sequel, please enjoy and thank you. After Bad Dog, Good Time and visiting a little party, you met a few friends, which includes Banjo who you definitely didn't play patty-cake with.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You had his number from a group-chat, but you broke your phone at work the next day, when getting a new phone, you lost your conversations and most of your contacts. You wondered if you'd ever see him again, does he think you ghosted him? </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a short visual novel to bridge a gap of time in between the two NSFW titles. It's primary goal is to provide a small backstory and feel of the character outside of the bedroom fun in the two games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There's a few gameplay elements that fall outside of the typical visual novel click-through and read. There is an early build of asteroid dodger which is an arcade style game, there is a mini-fishing game which gives a glimpse of what gameplay elements might come in Bad Dog, Good Nights.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Overall, I hope you enjoy reading and trying out a few new features planned and also knowing where the player (you) fits into all the titles.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As the second ever title I've built, I've tried to learn and add in a new few things, its not much but I hope you enjoy.</p>",
